OL,3,AUK cannot 'cherry pick' EU single
OL,4,Amarket deal, Barnier tells BBC
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe EU's former Brexit negotiator has
OL,7,Fwarned that the UK cannot "cherry pick"
OL,8,Fwhich elements of the single market to
OL,9,Fwhich it subscribes, after Andy Burnham
OL,10,Fsaid he wanted to explore closer
OL,11,Feconomic ties with Europe.
OL,13,FThe prime minister has said rejoining
OL,14,Fthe bloc's internal market was among
OL,15,Foptions he could pursue as part of a
OL,16,Freshaping of ties since the UK's exit
OL,17,Ffrom the EU nearly six years ago.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
