OL,3,AWith Stephen Miller pick, Trump readies
OL,4,Afor a battle
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the aftermath of the Republican
OL,7,FParty's sweeping defeat in Tuesday's
OL,8,Fmidterm elections, Donald Trump said he
OL,9,Fwould be willing to work with the newly
OL,10,Fascendent Democrats in Congress.
OL,12,FOn Friday, however, he elevated Stephen
OL,13,FMiller, his bare-knuckled political
OL,14,Foperative and longtime adviser, to
OL,15,Freplace Susie Wiles as White House
OL,16,Fchief of staff.
OL,18,FFar from an olive branch to Congress,
OL,19,FMiller's promotion could be a sign that
OL,20,Fthe president is girding for political
OL,21,Fbattle by installing a partisan
OL,22,Ffirebrand in the top White House job.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
