OL,3,AParaguay's president impeached and
OL,4,Aunder house arrest after bank collapse
OL,5,
OL,6,FParaguay's President Santiago Pena has
OL,7,Fbeen impeached and placed under house
OL,8,Farrest after a bank collapse triggered
OL,9,Fa crisis that left more than half of
OL,10,Fthe country's population without access
OL,11,Fto their accounts.
OL,13,FPena was arrested on Friday minutes
OL,14,Fafter lawmakers, including from his own
OL,15,Fparty, unanimously voted to remove him
OL,16,Ffrom office following the collapse
OL,17,Fearlier this week of Ueno Bank, which
OL,18,Fhas links to his private business
OL,19,Finterests.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
